I'd like to see 'bones files' for monsters. When playing over a network or with
a shared computer, it's wonderful fun to come across a named monster (see
article: "Bill Gates hits!"). The same goes for items that have been given
names. But this only happens when the monsters/items are on a bones file. It's
not really worth running round naming monsters when you just kill them anyway,
expecially if you weren't planning on dying and creating a bones file on that
level. So I'd like to see the computer remember the names we give to monsters
and items and use them in later games.

